ARTWORK AND LIKENESS (not covered by the MIT license above)

Jumba is a real dog and the artwork in this repository is of him. The
following are Copyright (c) 2026 Alex Wenson, all rights reserved, and are
NOT licensed for reuse, redistribution, or modification:

  Sources/Jumbini/Resources/jumba/     hand-made 8-direction dog sprites
  Sources/Jumbini/Resources/sprites/   bed variants (bedvar_1..12)
  Sources/Jumbini/Resources/Icons/     menu bar icons
  icon/                                app icon sources and iconsets
  jumbini-beds/                        bed art export folders
  hunched-over-state/                  pose art export folder
  sniffing-state/                      pose art export folder

The remaining sprite sheets in Sources/Jumbini/Resources/sprites/ (ball.png,
bed.png, heart.png, jar.png, rabbit.png, treat.png) are generated by
Tools/make_sprites.py and are covered by the MIT license above as output of
that source code.

You may fork this repository, build it, and reuse the code under the MIT
terms. If you ship something derived from it, replace the dog.
